erified glass-observers.ts separates EVALUABLE_FAIL, INVALID_OBSERVER, and INVALID_INTERFERENCE, checks rendered-frame ownership, validates helper hashes, runs eight negative controls, verifies protected paths, and tracks cleanup. conversation-hosts-probe.ts restores the full clipboard representation rather than only plain text. notes-actions-probe.ts compares descriptors, rows, and shortcuts, then activates advertised shortcuts and checks destructive pre-confirmation behavior. notes-search-probe.ts compares canonical IDs across multiple hosts and distinguishes ready-empty, no-match, loading, and failed-refresh states. flow-history-probe.ts crosses filesystem persistence, process restart, deletion, stale-write, and clipboard boundaries. validate-owner-map-paths.py uses structural parsing and migration-specific error classes rather than naïve string replacement. Do not label these verified merely because the source is elaborate. They need a current focused check and trustworthy output lineage. Work package E — Rust tests and source-audit policy Exact owned Rust paths tests/actions.rs tests/agent_chat_cmd_enter_entry_request_contract.rs tests/agent_chat_main_menu_skill_launch_contract.rs tests/agent_chat_targeted_reads.rs tests/automation/actions_dialog_targeting.rs tests/automation/detached_agent_chat_targeting.rs tests/automation/notes_window_targeting.rs tests/automation/window_targeting/mod.rs tests/automation_gpui_events/mod.rs tests/automation_screenshots/mod.rs tests/detached_agent_chat_popup_registry_surface_contract.rs tests/dictation_forced_routes/mod.rs tests/dictation_lifecycle_contract.rs tests/dictation_microphone_popup_contract.rs tests/dictation_overlay_focus_hide_contract.rs tests/dictation_tab_ai_harness.rs tests/main_window_footer_surface_owner_contract.rs tests/notes_browse_surface_contract.rs tests/notes_browse_text_state_contract.rs tests/portal_dictation_roundtrip_contract.rs tests/push_dictation_result_stub_contract.rs tests/sdk_automation_cont