y screenshot with the receipt proving claims the image cannot establish. Acceptance: captions explicitly state proof limits; keyboard, lifecycle, motion, focus, and temporal claims link to runtime receipts. Negative control: removing the runtime receipt downgrades the claim to illustration-only. Evidence: screenshot request file and article links. 11. Confidence rubric for the final package Use this decision table: EvidenceClassificationConfidence ceilingLedger or checked-in receipt onlyUNVERIFIED_CLAIMLowExact source control flow with forced wrong resultPROBABLE_DEFECTHighUnit mutation reproduces defectVERIFIED_REGRESSION or verified proof defectHighLive semantic state with exact target identityVerified only for semantic/model claimMedium–HighIndependent OS/pixel/filesystem/DB/clipboard/process boundaryVERIFIED_*HighScreenshot onlyIllustration or static visual findingMediumRuntime result with stale/missing identityPROOF_GAPLowINVALID_INTERFERENCEInvalid run, neither pass nor product failHighSource audit alone for runtime behaviorPROOF_GAPLow 12. Final package receipt 10-final-package-receipt.md must contain: Markdown# 05-proof-trust final package receipt - **Branch:** `consistency/default-recommendations` - **Base:** `{{MAIN_SHA}}` - **Head:** `{{HEAD_SHA}}` - **Owned paths:** `160` - **Accounted paths:** `160` - **Unreviewed paths:** `0` - **Observed improvements:** `{{N}}` - **Verified regressions:** `{{N}}` - **Probable defects:** `{{N}}` - **Proof gaps:** `{{N}}` - **Unverified claims:** `{{N}}` - **Refuted claims:** `{{N}}` - **Focused commands:** `{{N}}` - **Passing commands:** `{{N}}` - **Failing commands:** `{{N}}` - **Blocked commands:** `{{N}}` - **Invalid commands:** `{{N}}` - **Reruns used:** `{{N}}` - **Screenshot requests:** `{{N}}` - **Screenshots captured:** `{{N}}` - **Article hunks complete:** `yes` - **Next-step cards complete:** `12` - **New production edits:** `0` - **New unowned dirty paths:** `0` - **Package disposition:** `COMPLETE | COMPLET